      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. those are all really good points for the video. i want to make sure i don't sound like i'm just \"hating\" on it though... can you help me frame the arguments so it sounds like the 'gentle parenting' crowd is just following a trend that ignores actual developmental biology and science? like, how can i make it sound like their approach is scientifically unsound compared to more traditional methods?",
